   "Output", CellLabel -> "Out[7]="], Cell["LinearLayer[{}] gives a scalar, \
not a length-1 vector. It is the last layer of phi, which returns one pair \
force per edge. Its weights are a 1\[Times]d matrix.", "Text"], 
  Cell["lin0 = LinearLayer[{}, \"Weights\" -> {{1.5, -0.7}}, \"Biases\" -> \
