  Cell["3. ElementwiseLayer", "Section"], Cell["ElementwiseLayer[f] applies f \
to every entry. Without it the network would be linear, however many layers \
it had. PolymerNN uses Tanh, which is smooth, so the learned forces are \
smooth functions of r.", "Text"], Cell["tanh = \
ElementwiseLayer[Tanh];\n{tanh[{-2., 0., 0.5, 3.}], Tanh[{-2., 0., 0.5, \
3.}]}", "Input", CellLabel -> "In[9]:="], 
