          "}"}]}], "}"}]], "Output", CellLabel -> "Out[9]="], 
  Cell["4. NetChain", "Section"], Cell["NetChain puts layers one after \
another. Here it is a one-hidden-layer version of phi: radial basis (4) \
\[RightArrow] linear (2) \[RightArrow] tanh \[RightArrow] linear (scalar). \
PolymerNN's phi has two hidden layers of width 32: 16 \[RightArrow] 32 \
\[RightArrow] tanh \[RightArrow] 32 \[RightArrow] tanh \[RightArrow] 1.", 
   "Text"], Cell["phi = NetChain[{lin, ElementwiseLayer[Tanh], lin0}]", 
   "Input", CellLabel -> "In[10]:="], 
