   "Input", CellLabel -> "In[11]:="], 
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", "0.7721020579338074`"}], 
        ",", RowBox[{"-", "0.7721020306488255`"}]}], "}"}]], "Output", 
   CellLabel -> "Out[11]="], Cell["5. NetMapOperator", "Section"], 
  Cell["phi takes one edge, a 4-vector. The chain has several edges, a \
P\[Times]4 matrix. NetMapOperator[phi] applies phi to every row with the same \
weights, giving one number per edge. This weight sharing is what makes the \
trained network independent of the chain length: the number of parameters \
does not depend on P.", "Text"], 
  Cell["phiMap = NetMapOperator[phi];\n{phiMap[bfeat], phiByHand /@ bfeat}", 
   "Input", CellLabel -> "In[12]:="], 
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[
     {"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", "0.7721020579338074`"}], 
            ",", RowBox[{"-", "0.7672325372695923`"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"-", "0.7346272468566895`"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", "0.7721020306488255`"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"-", "0.7672324156901535`"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"-", "0.734627321912412`"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]], "Output", 
   CellLabel -> "Out[12]="], Cell["{\"parameters in phi\" -> Information[phi, \
\"ArraysTotalElementCount\"],\n \"parameters in NetMapOperator[phi], 3 \
edges\" -> Information[NetMapOperator[phi, \"Input\" -> {3, 4}], \
\"ArraysTotalElementCount\"],\n \"parameters in NetMapOperator[phi], 465 \
edges\" -> Information[NetMapOperator[phi, \"Input\" -> {465, 4}], \
\"ArraysTotalElementCount\"]}", "Input", CellLabel -> "In[13]:="], 
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"\"parameters in phi\"", 
          "\[Rule]", "13"}], ",", RowBox[
         {"\"parameters in NetMapOperator[phi], 3 edges\"", "\[Rule]", 
          "13"}], ",", RowBox[
         {"\"parameters in NetMapOperator[phi], 465 edges\"", "\[Rule]", 
          "13"}]}], "}"}]], "Output", CellLabel -> "Out[13]="], 
  Cell["The scalar on each edge is a pair force f(r). A positive value pushes \
the two beads apart.", "Text"], 
  Cell["fB = phiMap[bfeat]; fN = phiMap[nfeat];\n{fB, fN}", "Input", 
   CellLabel -> "In[14]:="], 
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[
     {"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", "0.7721020579338074`"}], 
            ",", RowBox[{"-", "0.7672325372695923`"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"-", "0.7346272468566895`"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
